@startuml 03-payment-state
title PayLink - Payment State Diagram (Phase 1)
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

[*] --> Initiated : payment created\n(fee locked, A-16)

Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud checks pass\nAND funds sufficient
Initiated --> Rejected : fraud check fails\nOR insufficient funds

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer by timeout (10 s)

Unknown --> Completed : late callback / retry /\nsettlement confirms
Unknown --> Failed : later refusal OR reconciliation\nestablishes non-payment

Failed --> Refunded : hold released

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Initiated
  No money moves in Initiated or Rejected.
  Rejected: no biller call is ever made.
end note

note right of FundsHeld
  Total (bill + fee) moves from available
  to held BEFORE the biller call.
end note

note left of Unknown
  Funds stay held. Never refunded automatically.
  Re-query at 1, 5 and 15 min after the initial
  timeout (not cumulative, A-21), then wait for
  reconciliation (A-24).
end note

note bottom of Completed
  FINAL. Capture of held funds, fee income and
  agent commission are posted here. A later refund
  uses a separate refund request and compensating
  ledger entries; this state does not change (A-12).
end note

note bottom of Refunded
  FINAL. Only reachable from Failed.
end note

note bottom of Rejected
  FINAL. Reached only from Initiated.
end note
@enduml